<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/gtin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Global Trade Item Number (GTIN)](https://www.gs1.org/standards/id-keys/gtin) is a number, assigned by GS1, that uniquely identifies a trade item (product or service)."@en .
